frpdash manages frp (https://github.com/fatedier/frp), which is a separate
project licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. frpdash does not
include frp's source code or binaries: it downloads the official frp release
at install time and verifies it against pinned SHA-256 checksums.
frpdash is not affiliated with or endorsed by the frp project.

Third-party components included in the frpdash binary are listed in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
